sequenceDiagram
    participant Patient
    participant System as Care Journey service
    participant Worker
    participant PaymentProvider as Payment provider
    participant Alerts as Alerts queue

    Patient->>System: reserve slot
    System->>System: create slot_hold with expires_at
    Patient->>PaymentProvider: initiate payment

    alt webhook arrives before expiry
        PaymentProvider-->>System: signed webhook
        System->>System: verify and confirm booking
    else webhook missing or delayed
        Worker->>PaymentProvider: query pending payment attempt
        PaymentProvider-->>Worker: payment status
        alt reference, amount, currency, target match
            Worker->>System: confirm booking
        else mismatch or unmatched
            Worker->>Alerts: raise Alert
        end
    end

    Worker->>Worker: release expired holds
    Note over Patient,PaymentProvider: verified payment after expiry creates a<br/>high-priority Alert and refund instruction<br/>never takes another patient's confirmed slot

    PaymentProvider-->>System: refunded or partially_refunded event
    System->>System: idempotent reconciliation updates payment record
    Note over System: Monovella records refunds but does not initiate them
